; RUN: dgtl-opt --pass=inlining --filecheck %s
; FileCheck test for Aggressive Inlining pass with regex patterns
;
; Demonstrates FileCheck's regex matching capabilities for validating
; that inlining transformations produce expected IR patterns.

; CHECK: \[\d+\] opcode
; CHECK-NEXT: result
; CHECK: flags
; CHECK-NOT: exception
; CHECK-DAG: opcode
; CHECK-DAG: result
